  "content": "Jack's \"jackpotting\" research from Black Hat USA 2010, where he made two ATMs on stage spit out cash on command, showed how default passwords, poor encryption, and insecure communication protocols left ATMs vulnerable . It was an industry wake-up call, forcing ATM manufacturers and banks to patch the vulnerabilities, develop new security standards, and rethink the security of these machines.",
